Package: golemstockindices
Title: Interactive Explorer of the Major Stock Market Indices
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Dimitrios", "Zacharatos", , "dzacharatos@yahoo.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1789-8294"))
Maintainer: Dimitrios Zacharatos <dzacharatos@yahoo.com>
Description: A 'shiny' application for exploring the major stock market
    indices of the Americas, Europe and Asia-Pacific, such as the S&P 500, the Euro Stoxx
    50 and the Nikkei 225, and the VIX. Shows where every index stands
    against its last close, the start of the year, a year ago and its
    all-time high, and plots interactive candlestick and volume charts of
    the whole history of each. Also compares normalized indices, and shows
    a calendar of monthly returns, their seasonality by day of the week,
    week of the year, month and year of the US presidential cycle, whether
    an index's recent volatility is normal, with a GARCH forecast, and its
    falls from its all-time high. Daily prices are retrieved from 'Yahoo
    Finance'.
